### PayVerse — reconciliation-service through the gateway (ADMIN runs jobs and resolves; SUPPORT reads).

### Run PG charges vs ledger for today (IST); returns the RUNNING run — poll it
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/recon/jobs/PG_VS_LEDGER/run
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {% client.global.set("runId", response.body.id); %}

### Other jobs: TRANSFERS_VS_UPI, WALLET_INTEGRITY; any past day with ?date=2026-10-16
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/recon/jobs/TRANSFERS_VS_UPI/run?date=2026-10-16
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### The run (counts and status)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/recon/runs/{{runId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Its mismatches
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/recon/runs/{{runId}}/mismatches
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Recent runs
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/recon/runs?job=PG_VS_LEDGER
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Open mismatches across runs
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/recon/mismatches
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

> {% if (response.body.items.length > 0) client.global.set("mismatchId", response.body.items[0].id); %}

### Resolve one with an explanation (ADMIN)
POST {{gateway}}/api/v1/admin/recon/mismatches/{{mismatchId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Charge refunded at the gateway (ticket OPS-123)" }
